{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/netzeroexpeditions/items/264194/", "pk": 264194, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/netzeroexpeditions/", "pk": 62352, "shortname": "netzeroexpeditions", "name": "Net Zero Expeditions", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Pelagic Wildlife Expedition (6 Hrs)", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 11, "unicode": "Pelagic Wildlife Expedition (6 Hrs)", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 2000, "description": "# Pelagic Wildlife Expedition \n## Duration\n6 hours\n\n## About\n\nDive into the heart of the **Ocean** off San Diego's coast for a special experience. The primary goal of this expedition is to **swim alongside the elusive and majestic Mola Mola (Sunfish)**, one of the ocean's most enigmatic creatures. The offshore waters also offer incredible opportunities to witness **bait balls** and a variety of non-mammal pelagic species, providing a truly immersive encounter with marine life beyond the ordinary.\n\nWhile the focus is on pelagic life, the open ocean holds more surprises. **Depending on the season**, you may also spot **Gray Whales** during the winter and spring, **Blue Whales** in the summer, and **Humpback Whales** in the fall, as well as various species of **dolphins** that frequent these waters year-round.\n\nThis **unique excursion** is designed for those eager to explore the pelagic ecosystem, far from the coastline and into the deep blue, where encounters with the ocean’s most fascinating creatures await.\n\n## Experience Level\n\nSuitable for both beginners and intermediates. No scuba diving experience is necessary, but a familiarity with snorkeling and good physical condition is recommended.\n\n## Departure and Return\n\n- **Departures**: Daily trips available.\n- **Return**: Approximately 3:00 PM, depending on weather and guest preferences.\n\n## Departure Location:  \n**Mission Bay**, San Diego, California\n\n## Expedition Includes:\n\n- Refreshments and healthy snacks during the journey.\n- Feel free to bring your own meals and snorkeling equipment to enhance your experience.\n\n## Important Information:\n\n- Please notify us of any dietary restrictions in advance.\n- **Wildlife Disclaimer**: While we strive for exceptional encounters, the open ocean is unpredictable. Sightings of Mola Molas, whales, and dolphins are not guaranteed but occur frequently depending on the season.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "##Please make sure to read the frequently asked questions on our website and get ready for the iridescent blue experience!", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "6 hours • Ages 5+ to book • Up to 6 people!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/netzeroexpeditions/items/264194/images/1280509/", "pk": 1280509, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/sCZPZAWRRiQTbeVxMS4A", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/sCZPZAWRRiQTbeVxMS4A", "company": {"cls": "Compa